# Line endings on every machine, Windows' too. Git for Windows writes a text file with CRLF by default
# (core.autocrlf), and bash cannot run a script whose lines end so: the shell scripts and Gradle's wrapper keep LF,
# the wrapper's batch file keeps CRLF. deploy/windows.sh is run in Git Bash (docs/DEPLOY_GUIDE.md).
*.sh        text eol=lf
gradlew     text eol=lf
*.bat       text eol=crlf
